---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../config';
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 sm:py-40 bg-dark-300">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">About Me</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-gray-300">
        <p>
          I'm a full-stack developer with 2+ years of professional experience,
          specializing in React and Node.js with TypeScript. I previously worked
          with Ruby on Rails and pick up new stacks quickly when projects demand
          it.
        </p>
        <p>
          My most recent role was on the development team of an Electronic Lab
          Notebook (ELN) solution for a biotech company, where I built new
          features and maintained the existing product to streamline research
          workflows for scientists. I'm currently sharpening my skills through
          hands-on projects — including a Kanban board app and a coffee truck
          discovery platform for Israel — while actively seeking my next role.
        </p>
        <p>
          I leverage AI-assisted development tools — agentic workflows with
          Claude Code and Opencode, MCP integrations — to design systems, debug
          efficiently, and maintain high test coverage. I treat them as a force
          multiplier, not a crutch.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm based in Kfar Saba, Israel, and always happy to chat about new
          opportunities, clean code, or what the market's doing today.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3 sm:gap-4">
        <a
          href={SITE_CONFIG.github}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-4 py-2.5 sm:px-6 sm:py-3 border border-primary text-primary font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-primary hover:text-dark-100 transition-colors text-sm sm:text-base">
          GitHub
        </a>
        <a
          href={SITE_CONFIG.linkedin}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="px-4 py-2.5 sm:px-6 sm:py-3 border border-primary text-primary font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-primary hover:text-dark-100 transition-colors text-sm sm:text-base">
          LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
